## Programme

- 17:30 Welcome
- 17:45 Talk: which prices lose money, and why nobody saw it
- 18:30 Break
- 18:45 Open discussion
- 19:30 Drinks

## About the evening

In our [pricing review](/projects/pricing-review-for-a-logistics-group/), we found that a few old contracts cost the client more than they earned. The talk shows how we found them, how we talked to the customers, and what changed in the first year.

The open discussion is for owners and managers of transport and storage companies. Bring your own pricing question. We do not share any company data from the room.

Seats are limited. Please register early, and tell us if you need a seat with step-free access.
